WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,605
Scott Hanley pours drinks at Candlelight Tavern on South Pearl, in Wash Park.

2
00:00:05,605 --> 00:00:09,539
He has been behind that bar for going on twenty-seven years.

3
00:00:09,539 --> 00:00:13,644
Chris Johnson has worked beside him for most of that stretch.

4
00:00:13,644 --> 00:00:16,631
They have known each other since the early nineties.

5
00:00:16,631 --> 00:00:24,881
They started at the Himalaya in Aurora, moved through a few other bars, then landed at Candlelight under Dave and Lisa Bryan.

6
00:00:24,881 --> 00:00:29,710
In twenty seventeen, Lisa told Westword that Scott is a legend.

7
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:30,945
She meant it.

8
00:00:30,945 --> 00:00:33,275
In twenty eighteen he got sick.

9
00:00:33,275 --> 00:00:37,486
The neighborhood showed up with fundraisers, a pub crawl, and a GoFundMe.

10
00:00:37,486 --> 00:00:39,236
He came back to the bar.

11
00:00:39,236 --> 00:00:46,631
On November tenth, twenty twenty-five, the Colorado Restaurant Association named him HOSPY Bartender of the Year.

12
00:00:46,631 --> 00:00:48,526
Wash Park already knew.

13
00:00:48,526 --> 00:00:49,881
Pull up a stool.

14
00:00:49,881 --> 00:00:51,250
He is still there.

